# AgriAether — environment variable template. Copy to .env and fill in real
# values locally; .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# The current weather provider (Open-Meteo, see src/weather/OpenMeteoProvider.ts)
# is used specifically because it requires NO API key — its free tier is
# keyless. Nothing below is required to run the app today.
#
# This file exists to document the pattern for a FUTURE provider that does
# require a key. IMPORTANT: Vite bundles any `VITE_`-prefixed variable
# directly into the client-side build — it is visible to anyone who opens
# the app, not a real secret. A provider that requires a genuinely private
# key cannot be called directly from this frontend as it stands; it would
# need a small backend/proxy to hold the key server-side first. See the
# README's Security section.

# VITE_WEATHER_API_KEY=
